screens.prose:
You built a payoff library. Its shape:

```cpp
class Payoff {                        // the one question
public:
    virtual ~Payoff() = default;      // safe delete via base
    virtual double operator()(double spot) const = 0;
};
class Call : public Payoff {          // one class per payoff
public:
    double operator()(double spot) const override;
};
double price(const Payoff& p /* ... */);  // never copied
```

